Let the port draw some of the game's textures from other art (the Legend of
Mana Remaster's UI pictures, src/remaster/remaster_ui.c), the way PS1
emulators' texture packs work: it hears what each upload and copy puts in video
memory, and is asked before each textured sprite and four-point polygon is
drawn, so it can draw one itself instead.

